('01M4D6BJ68YWZMG6KTEA992RRF', 'indicator', '01M4D6BHK05248EWS4XAS9WYD3', 'Environmental Inspections Conducted | عمليات التفتيش البيئي المنفذة | Number of environmental inspections carried out in the year. | عدد عمليات التفتيش البيئي المنفذة خلال السنة. | Latest values: 2025: 24583 inspections; 2024: 20631 inspections; 2023: 17403 inspections | Source: NCEC inspection records (illustrative demo series) | Frequency: annual', 'en', '\', 'local-hash-256', '2026-10-08T07:24:00.584Z', NULL),
('01M4D6BJ68FT12R3BJ0C8T8M2X', 'indicator', '01M4D6BHK1G5A11XETTMF62R4C', 'Environmental Violations Recorded | المخالفات البيئية المسجلة | Number of environmental violations recorded in the year. | عدد المخالفات البيئية المسجلة خلال السنة. | Latest values: 2025: 4596 violations; 2024: 4145 violations; 2023: 3602 violations | Source: NCEC inspection records (illustrative demo series) | Frequency: annual', 'en', '\', 'local-hash-256', '2026-10-08T07:24:00.584Z', NULL),
